# Shadcn & UI Conventions

## Component location

- Shadcn primitives live in `src/components/ui/` — no business logic
- App chrome (header, footer, layout) in `src/components/layout/`
- Domain UI in `src/features/<domain>/components/`

## Styling

- Use semantic Tailwind tokens: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-destructive`, etc.
- Do not use raw hex colors or arbitrary color values in components
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes

## Documentation

- Add JSDoc (`/** */`) to exported functions, types, and non-obvious variables
- Avoid filler comments that restate what the code already says

## Forms

- Define Zod schemas in `features/<name>/form/`
- Use React Hook Form with `@hookform/resolvers/zod`
- Return `AppResponseType<T>` from client API calls

## Routes

- Use constants from `@/lib/routes` — never hardcode path strings
